# mæchlang · Authority

Evidence ≠ Authority. Many agents. One principal.
Sketch in Mech syntax (v0.3 guide). Not yet run on a Mech runtime.

```mech
<authority> := :æ0 | :æ1 | :æ2 | :æ3

agents := {"hark", "hermes", "codex"}
principal := "yæl"

#Authority(req<u8>) ⇒ <u8> :=
  ├ :Context(req<u8>)
  ├ :Evidence(req<u8>)
  └ :Granted(level<u8>).

#Authority(req<u8>) → :Context(req)
  :Context(r)
    ├ r < 2u8 → :Granted(r)     -- æ0 public, æ1 published
    └ r > 1u8 → :Evidence(r)    -- æ2 operator, æ3 custody
  :Evidence(r) → :Granted(r)     -- only after passkey + Witness receipt
  :Granted(l) ⇒ l
.

#Authority(3u8)
```
